<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "View the server's Message of the Day — a welcome message from the server administrators that is also shown automatically when you first connect."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_question}>{dgettext("help_commands", "When to Use It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Use it to read the server news or rules again after they scrolled out of the Status window. It is also the way to read a new MOTD that was posted while you were connected."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/motd")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Displays the current server MOTD in the Status tab. The MOTD is shown automatically when you connect, and you can re-view it at any time with /motd or Help > Message of the Day. If no MOTD has been set by the administrators, you'll see a \"No MOTD has been set\" message."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "When an administrator changes or clears the MOTD while you are connected, a short note in the Status window tells you so. The new text is not shown by itself. Type %{command} to read it.",
    command: "/motd"
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Anyone can use it. No channel or server status is needed.")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "The command takes no parameters. Anything you type after it is ignored."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "Only server administrators can change the MOTD, with %{set} or %{clear}.",
      set: "/setmotd",
      clear: "/clearmotd"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/motd")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-setmotd">{dgettext("help_commands", "/setmotd")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-clearmotd">{dgettext("help_commands", "/clearmotd")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="ui-message-of-the-day">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Message of the Day Menu")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-special-messages">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Special Messages")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
